name    mod-dungeon-challenge: boss adds, health auras, entry changes and mob heals keep the run's scaling
# Server-side test bot run (mod-fl-testbots), T1. The three scaling holes of the Mythic+ survey (2026-10-10 §4), in
# Utgarde Keep (heroic) at challenge level 28 (health x2.4, damage x1.56 with the workbench's 5 % / 2 % per level):
#   1. boss adds: Prince Keleseth (23953) summons five Vrykul Skeletons (23970) 4 s into the fight. A skeleton is
#      4383-4534 health unscaled (heroic 31635, level 80-81) and 10519-10882 scaled - the check is > 8000.
#   2. health auras: Commanding Shout (469, +health) on a scaled skeleton runs Creature::UpdateMaxHealth, which
#      used to rebuild the maximum from the unscaled UNIT_MOD_HEALTH. The maximum must stay > 8000.
#      An entry change (`.npc set entry`, the core's UpdateEntry -> SelectLevel, as a boss phase change) on a
#      Dragonflayer Runecaster (heroic 31663: 63000-65165 unscaled, >= 151200 scaled) must be re-scaled: > 120000.
#   3. mob heals: the skeleton drinks a Super Healing Potion on itself (`.cast self`, 28495: 1500-2500, no crit:
#      damage class none) after `.damage 9500` left it at 1019-1363. Scaled x2.4 the heal is 3600-6000, so its
#      health ends above 4619; unscaled it would end below 3863 - the check is > 4200.
# The run is started through the Dungeon Challenge NPC (500000) in Azealia, which also proves its difficulty
# menu no longer lists 100 levels (the core ASSERTs past 32 gossip options): level 28 is option 7 of
# 1, 4, 8, ..., 100. The director pulls Keleseth in `.cheat god`; bot a only starts the run and stays at the
# entrance.
timeout 240s

bot a warrior
group party

place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
require a alive
pick stone creature:500000 near a
require stone exists
do a approach stone
do a gossip stone
expect output has "Start Dungeon Challenge"
do a select 0
expect output has "Utgarde Keep"
do a select 0
expect output has "Level 28"
expect output lacks "Level 27"
do a select 7
do a select 0
waitfor a map 574 timeout 20s
waitfor gm map 574 timeout 20s
wait 2s

log 1 - boss adds are scaled
as gm .cheat god on
pick kel creature:23953 near gm
require kel exists
do gm goto 183.0 199.0 40.9
do gm approach kel
do gm attack kel
waitfor kel incombat timeout 10s
wait 7s
pick skel creature:23970 near gm
require skel exists
do gm target skel
as gm .npc info
expect skel maxhealth > 8000

log 3 - a mob heal on a scaled mob is scaled
as gm .damage 9500
expect skel health < 1500
as gm .cast self 28495 triggered
wait 1s
expect skel health > 4200

log 2 - a health aura keeps the scaled maximum
as gm .aura 469
wait 1s
expect skel aura 469
expect skel maxhealth > 8000

log 2b - an entry change is re-scaled
pick rc creature:23960 near gm
require rc exists
expect rc maxhealth > 120000
do gm target rc
as gm .npc set entry 23960
wait 2s
expect rc maxhealth > 120000

cleanup
as gm .cheat god off
place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
